@startuml
actor Student
actor Instructor

Student --> (Login)
Student --> (Register)
Student --> (View Enrolled Courses)
Student --> (View Grades)

Instructor --> (Login)
Instructor --> (Register)
Instructor --> (Create Course)
Instructor --> (Assign Grades)
Instructor --> (View Enrolled Students)

note right of (Register): Email must be unique for all users
note right of (Assign Grades): Instructor assigns grades to students in their courses
note right of (View Enrolled Courses): Includes viewing the course instructor

@enduml